  "commands": {
    "smt": "python3 scripts/perf/scale/sailfish_dag.py SRC --rounds R --out NEW_DIR. Repeat each emitted SMT-LIB query with cvc5 FILE. Refuses edits to the pinned sources. The listed larger checks change only the upper endpoint of R.",
    "explicit": "Change only R == 1..5 to 1..R in a uniquely named copy of TLCSailfish2.tla. Retain the original CFG. dive check MODULE --config TLCSailfish2.cfg --workers 1 --seed 0 --fp 0 --store exact --max-memory 2g --time-limit LIMIT --output json. Pinned TLC: java -Xmx1800m -XX:ActiveProcessorCount=1 -jar tla2tools.jar -workers 1 -fp 0 -seed 0 -config TLCSailfish2.cfg MODULE. One-/two-round TLC includes -dump dot,actionlabels OUT.dot. Limits 110s through round two, 680s for round three.",
    "graph_audit": "python3 scripts/perf/scale/sailfish_dag_graph.py OUT.dot --rounds R. Compare admissibility and all labeled insertion choices and terminal self-loops by individual TLC state.",
    "witness": "Restrict original Next to add the next scheduled vertex (by round then n1 to n4), with either all prior vertices or the listed mixed parent choice. Check added BeforeDone == ~Done. Set the witness ending to behavior and clear diagnostic action labels, then run dive validate-trace MODULE --config TLCSailfish2.cfg --trace FILE --seed 0 --fp 0 --output json. Empty the final vertex set and repeat."
  },
